Commands for pushing transcripts to, and authenticating with, the Peasant village.

Usage:
  peasant village [flags]
  peasant village [command]

Available Commands:
  annotations Sync foreign annotations on your pushed transcripts
  hooks       Install, inspect, and remove the repository's village upload hooks
  login       Log in to the Peasant village via GitHub
  logout      Log out from the Peasant village
  push        Push ingested transcripts to the Peasant village
  transcripts Pull, list, and view transcripts from the Peasant village

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for village

Global Flags:
      --config string       Path to config file (default: ~/.config/peasant/config.yaml) (default "/home/dev/.config/peasant/config.yaml")
      --config-dir string   Override the config directory (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME or ~/.config); config lives under <config-dir>/peasant
      --data-dir string     Override the data directory (default: $XDG_DATA_HOME or ~/.local/share); the DB + peasant-sync live under <data-dir>/peasant
      --state-dir string    Override the state directory (default: $XDG_STATE_HOME or ~/.local/state); logs/PID live under <state-dir>/peasant
  -v, --version             Print the version

Use "peasant village [command] --help" for more information about a command.
